  "question": {
    "text": "A particle is executing simple harmonic motion <math><mo>(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>)</mo></math> of amplitude <math><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo></math> along the <math><mi>x</mi></math> -axis, about <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math> When its potential Energy <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> equal kinetic energy <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> the position of the particle will be:"
  },
